<title>UK: Field finance director leaving for Oxfam.</title>
<headline>Field finance director leaving for Oxfam.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Field Group Plc said on Wednesday that its finance director David Nussbaum was resigning to become finance director at charity organisation Oxfam.</p>
<p>Nussbaum has given six months notice to the UK paper and packaging company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
